                "type": "textComponent",
                "text": "Acquired by Fireworks AI in March 2026: https://fireworks.ai/blog/fireworks-acquires-hathora\n\nWe founded Hathora after realizing there was no compute platform that was high-performance, cost-effective, and developer-friendly - especially for real-time workloads like multiplayer games. Since then, we’ve expanded to support both CPU and GPU workloads across strategic global regions, helping teams efficiently run everything from games to AI inference. \n\nOur hybrid infrastructure layer, Elastic Metal, combines the performance and price of bare metal with the flexibility of the cloud—making it possible for teams of any size to integrate bare metal into their compute stack without the traditional overhead."
